## 1. DEVICE IDENTIFICATION:
id: mitsubishi-melsec-fx5u
name: "Mitsubishi MELSEC iQ-F FX5U-32MR/ES — Compact PLC; 34ns LD instruction; 64K steps Flash; 16DI 24VDC sink/source; 16DO relay 2A 250VAC; 2 AI + 1 AO 12-bit built-in; 6x200kHz HSC; Ethernet 8conn; RS-485 MODBUS; SD card; 100-240VAC"
manufacturer: "Mitsubishi Electric Corporation"
mcu: "Mitsubishi MELSEC iQ-F FX5U CPU — 34ns LD instruction; 64K steps non-volatile flash; 0.2ms constant scan; IEC61131-3 LD-ST-FBD-SFC; built-in Ethernet + RS-485; 12-bit 2AI+1AO; 6ch 200kHz HSC; supercap RTC ~10 days"
